<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Freedom from all the carnal affections,</l><l>Freedom from envy, hatred and strife;</l><l>Freedom from vain and worldly ambitions.</l><l>Freedom from all that saddened my life.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Freedom from pride and all sinful follies,</l><l>Freedom from love and glitter of gold;</l><l>Freedom from evil temper and anger,</l><l>Glorious freedom, rapture untold.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Freedom from fear with all of its torments,</l><l>Freedom from care with all of its pain;</l><l>Freedom in Christ my blessed Redeemer,</l><l>He who has rent my fetters in twain.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
